wget
Usage: wget [-cqS] [--spider] [-O FILE] [-o LOGFILE] [--header STR]
	[--post-data STR | --post-file FILE] [-Y on/off]
	[--no-check-certificate] [-P DIR] [-U AGENT] [-T SEC] URL...

Retrieve files via HTTP or FTP.

	--spider	Check URL, no save
	--header STR	Add a header line
	--post-data STR	POST STR as body
	--post-file FILE	Send FILE using POST method
	--no-check-certificate	Skip TLS cert check
	-c		Resume partial file
	-q		Quiet
	-P DIR		Save into DIR
	-S    		Show server response
	-T SEC		Timeout: SEC seconds
	-O FILE		Save as FILE
	-o LOGFILE	Log messages to FILE
	-U AGENT	Use AGENT for User-Agent header
	-Y on/off	Use proxy
